  m_text: "MOVEMENT & CONTROLS\r\n\r\nW A S D   \u2014   MOVE\r\nNavigate through
    the facility.\r\n\r\nMOUSE     \u2014   LOOK\r\nLook around your surroundings.\r\n\r\nSHIFT 
    + MOVE   \u2014   SPRINT\r\nMove faster, but make more noise.\r\n\r\nCTRL + MOVE    
    \u2014   CROUCH\r\nMove slowly and quietly.\r\n\r\nSPACE     \u2014   JUMP\r\nJump
    over obstacles.\r\n\r\nE    \u2014   INTERACT\r\nInteract with doors and objects."
