  m_text: 'SURVIVAL



    STAY QUIET

    Sound can attract unwanted attention.



    MOVE
    CAREFULLY

    Different actions create different levels of noise.



    USE
    YOUR ENVIRONMENT

    Objects around the facility may help you survive.



    STAY
    ALERT

    Listen carefully and watch your surroundings.



    FIND A WAY OUT

    Explore
    the facility and uncover your path to escape.'
