  m_text: "Echo Escape is a single-player, first-person survival horror game set
    within the abandoned Shadowstone Research Facility.\n\nFollowing a facility-wide
    power failure and lockdown, you must navigate the darkened research complex while
    avoiding Specimen 6 \u2014 \u201CEcho,\u201D a blind predator that hunts through
    sound.\n\nExplore. Stay quiet. Find a way out.\nDeveloped by Quantum Pixel Studios.\n\nCOMP307
    \u2014 Computer Graphics\n2026"
